{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよーござます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵書くの好き？？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はけっこうすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナレーターのお仕事などにも\n興味はありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫のナレ録りや個人pvなどで\nしてたら...読むの楽しいなと\n思うようになりました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"韓国語ってできる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvで韓国行ったとき\nアンニョンハセヨ\nカムサハムニダ\nこのふたつでやりぬきました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー...つまり、、\nできません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫でまりかが朗読した小説の中で\n一番お気に入りの作品はなに？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちばん最初にやった\nドグラ・マグラがいちばん衝撃的\nというか、やっぱり印象的な作品。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋個握"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は2部と3部です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服は...うーんボーイッシュ⁇です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝てたら\n若干のどやられました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声が小さくてか聞こえにくかったら\nごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手楽しみー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/7762496/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょわっち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}